{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45237","headline":"乌程李明府水堂同卢使君幼平送奘上人游五台 · 皎然","name":"乌程李明府水堂同卢使君幼平送奘上人游五台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身将刘令隐，经共谢公翻。\n有此宗师在，应知我法存。\n问心常寂乐，爲别岂伤魂。\n独访华泉去，秋风入雁门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45237.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45237","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}